{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29797","headline":"过故崔兖海宅与崔明秀才话旧因寄僚杜赵李三掾 · 李商隐","name":"过故崔兖海宅与崔明秀才话旧因寄僚杜赵李三掾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绦帐恩如昨，乌衣事莫寻。\n诸生空会葬，旧掾已华簪。\n共入留宾驿，俱分市骏金。\n莫凭无鬼论，终负托孤心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}